  "prose": [
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "正负数乘法满足分配律：",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 128,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0137#7"
      ],
      "source_text": "正负数乘法满足分配律：",
      "changes": [],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "对于任意数$a$、$b$和$c$，等式$(a+b)c=ac+bc$成立.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 128,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0137#8"
      ],
      "source_text": "对于任意数$a$、$b$和$c$，等式$(a+b)c=ac+bc$成立.",
      "changes": [],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "我们设$a=7$，$b=-5$，$c=-3$来验证等式$(a+b)c=ac+bc$.求左边的值：\n$(7-5)\\cdot(-3)=2\\cdot(-3)=-6$.求右边的值：\n$7\\cdot(-3)+(-5)\\cdot(-3)=-21+15=-6$.两边所得结果相同.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 128,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0137#9"
      ],
      "source_text": "我们设$a=7$，$b=-5$，$c=-3$来验证等式$(a+b)c=ac+bc$.求左边的值：$(7-5)\\cdot(-3)=2\\cdot(-3)=-6$.求右边的值：$7\\cdot(-3)+(-5)\\cdot(-3)=-21+15=-6$.两边所得结果相同.",
